      "content": "I'm not sure I follow the comparison, I'm just looking for the technical details. Can you expand more on the protein content part? Specifically, how does the buffering capacity of the gluten network actually interact with the organic acids produced by the Lactobacillus to prevent those pH spikes? I'm trying to calculate a more stable feeding schedule based on the flour type I'm using.",
